    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 25 · No-show Recovery\nOnly a person knows an inspection was missed. Mark it in Supabase:\n`UPDATE appointments SET status='NO_SHOW' WHERE id='…';`\nWithin 30 minutes (9 AM–8 PM local) the customer gets one kind text with real open times; replying with a number rebooks through 04 → 10.\nClaim-then-send (`no_show_recovery_sent_at`) means it is never sent twice.",
        "width": 620,
